                <pb facs="0394" n="387" sameAs="frus:frus1937v03/pg387"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">793.94/9305: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in China</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Johnson</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1937-08-12T20:00:00-04:00">August 12, 1937—8
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>144. Reference Shanghai’s 458, August 12, 7 p.m., second paragraph, and
                    Department’s 141, August 12, 2 p.m.<anchor n="85" xml:id="d426-f1"/> The
                    Department authorizes you, in your discretion, to make the representations
                    recommended by Shanghai.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
